ID: B2-Ch05a-Troll-dead
TEXT:

 "Hey! Velgos!" the announcer's voice cracks over the amphitheater. "What are you doing down there? Get on your feet! Stop fooling around and fight! What do you think we're paying you for?"

A dead, hollow silence descends across the tiers. Forty thousand spectators stare down at the corpse in the sand, entirely unsure of how to react. Velgos was the house favorite—a guaranteed slaughter machine—and watching him suffocate on his own failed flesh has drained all the blood from the stands. No cheers go up for us, but no boos either. Just the dry desert wind whistling through the canvas canopies while the announcer unravels in his elevated box.

"Velgos..." The man's voice drops to a frantic whimper. "Don't do this to me! I put five hundred gold on you! You can't drop dead in the second wave! What about the remaining divisions? Who is going to fight the other pens? Velgos, get up, damn you!"

A dry, deliberate throat-clearing cuts through the rant from somewhere in the shadows behind the announcer's booth. Venard has entered the box.

"Ah. Pray excuse me, ladies and gentlemen," the announcer squeaks. "I shall return momentarily."

He ducks into the pavilion hallway, his robes trailing behind him.

I tune the box out completely, stepping over to the two heavy scimitars lying half-buried in the sand. I turn them over with the toe of my boot. The steel is pristine, untarnished by the fire or the sand, and the magic hums faintly against my palms when I lift one by the grip. Sharpness and durability enchantments, woven tight into the fuller. Higher quality than most standard military issue—on par with Daren's dagger work.

Dual-wielding isn't my style, but a longer reach has its uses when facing polearms. And if I take both, Daren can identify the precise weave so I can fetch top coin from the weapon merchants in the upper district.

choice("Leave the weapons there", B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_current_scene = B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_b2_ch5_scimitar = 0)
choice("Take one scimitar", B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_current_scene = B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_b2_ch5_scimitar = 1)
choice("Take both scimitars", B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_current_scene = B2-Ch05a-Troll-Aftermath, v_b2_ch5_scimitar = 2)


