 Bruce jogs over from the perimeter, wiping gore from his knuckles.

"You dropped the troll already?" he asks, staring at Velgos's corpse.

"Finished him minutes ago," I say. "What kept you?"

"How did the mage end up dead?" Bruce asks, nodding at the charred remains across the sand.

"Triggered an illegal casting device," I say. "Resonance alarms went off and everything. How did you miss the sirens?"

"Too busy keeping iron out of my skull," Bruce grunts. He wipes his brow. "So, is the wave done, or what? What are we standing around for?"

"We wait for the announcer," I say. "He has to officially call the end of the round."

}
